; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    72   **********************************************************************************************************************/
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    73  /*! \brief          Trace thread-switches, where thread stands for task or ISR
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    74   *  \details        This hook routine allows external tools to trace all context switches from task to ISR and back as
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    75   *                  well as between tasks and between ISRs. So external tools may visualize the information or measure
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    76   *                  the execution time of tasks and ISRs.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    77   *                  Mind that measured execution time values may not reflect the worst case, which would be necessary
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    78   *                  for schedulability analysis.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    79   *
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    80   *                  Callers:
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    81   *                    - Os_TraceThreadSwitch()
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    82   *                    - Os_TraceThreadResetAndResume()
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    83   *                    - Os_TraceThreadCleanupAndResume()
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    84   *                    - Os_TraceThreadSuspendAndStart()
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    85   *
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    86   *  \param[in]      FromThreadId     The ID of the thread which has run until the switch
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Trace.h	    87   *  \param[in]      FromThreadReason Represents the reason why the thread is no longer running:
